             |                   |
             +---------+---------+
                       |
                       v
                  API Gateway
                       |
          +------------+------------+
          |            |            |
          v            v            v
       User         Movie       Streaming
      Service       Service       Service
          |            |            |
          +------------+------------+
                       |
                       v
                    MySQL

And additionally:

Movie/User activity
       |
       v
Recommendation Service
       |
       v
Personalized recommendations
6. DevOps pipeline

The complete software delivery flow will be:

Developer
    |
    v
Git
    |
    v
GitHub
    |
    v
Jenkins
    |
    +--> Maven
    +--> npm
    +--> Unit Tests
    +--> SonarQube
    +--> Security Scan
    +--> Docker Build
    |
    v
Amazon ECR
    |
    v
Kubernetes / EKS

So when we make a code change:

git push
    ↓
GitHub
    ↓
Jenkins
    ↓
Build
    ↓
Test
    ↓
SonarQube
    ↓
Security Scan
    ↓
Docker Image
    ↓
ECR
    ↓
EKS
    ↓
Application Updated
