9. Infrastructure automation
Terraform

Terraform will create/manage infrastructure:

Terraform
    |
    +--> VPC
    +--> Subnets
    +--> Security Groups
    +--> IAM
    +--> ALB
    +--> ECR
    +--> RDS
    +--> EKS
Ansible

Ansible will handle configuration/administration automation:

Ansible
   |
   +--> Server configuration
   +--> Package installation
   +--> Application configuration
   +--> Administrative tasks

Simple distinction:

Terraform = Build infrastructure

Ansible   = Configure/manage systems
